      "partNumber": 3,
      "rangeLabel": "Questions 15-20",
      "instruction": "You will hear part of an interview with a man called Tony Elliott who founded a magazine called Time Out. For questions 15-20, choose the answer (A, B, C or D) which fits best according to what you hear.",
      "matchingDualTask": false,
      "questions": [
        {
